<section class="cc-name">
  <div class="cc-name-inner">
    <div class="cc-eyebrow cc-eyebrow--center">Don't let the name fool you</div>

    <p class="cc-name-quote" style="margin-top: var(--sp-7);">
      Don't let yourself be fooled by the name <em>certification course.</em>
      It sounds like it's only for professionals — people who'll work with
      Somatic Vocal Healing professionally. And yes, that is part of it.
      It is to get the certificate, to open your own practice, to integrate
      Somatic Vocal Healing into the work you already do. But it's more
      than that. It is really an all-encompassing deepening trajectory — a
      path that allows you to go much deeper, because all of the sessions,
      if you join, will be live. That's quite a powerful thing.
    </p>
    <div class="cc-name-by">— Jacob</div>

    <p class="cc-name-tag">
      <strong>This course has a dual purpose.</strong> First, it is about you.
      Second, about your capacity to guide, facilitate, and hold space for
      others. Everything you learn to do for someone else can perfectly be
      applied to yourself.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
